WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.367 --> 00:00:03.236
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:00:03.236 --> 00:00:06.472
-Kim, it's --
it's so fun having you here.

00:00:06.472 --> 00:00:09.476
-Aw, Aidy,
I'm having so much fun, too.

00:00:09.476 --> 00:00:11.477
-I mean, your life
seems so exciting,

00:00:11.477 --> 00:00:16.148
like jets and sisters
and an underpants company.

00:00:16.148 --> 00:00:18.484
Oh, Kim, are -- are you crying?

00:00:18.484 --> 00:00:20.253
