00:00:20.253 --> 00:00:21.755
I'm just so busy all the time.

00:00:21.755 --> 00:00:24.957
I just want
one normal, boring day,

00:00:24.957 --> 00:00:27.660
kind of like the day
you have every day.

00:00:27.660 --> 00:00:29.896
-Ouch. But it's true.

00:00:29.896 --> 00:00:33.866
I-I mean, I kind of wish
we could just switch places.

00:00:33.866 --> 00:00:35.435
-Well...

00:00:35.435 --> 00:00:38.237
I do have this magic clock.

00:00:38.237 --> 00:00:41.507
-Wait a minute. You want to use
this clock's dark magic

00:00:41.507 --> 00:00:45.311
to switch places for 24 hours
without anyone knowing?

00:00:45.311 --> 00:00:46.445
Okay, bitch.

00:00:46.445 --> 00:00:47.780
[ Thunder crashes ]

00:00:47.780 --> 00:00:51.317
[ Energy crackling ]
-Ticktock one and ticktock two.

00:00:51.317 --> 00:00:54.521
You are me and I am you...

00:00:54.521 --> 00:00:56.355
for one day.

00:00:56.355 --> 00:00:58.190 line:0%
♪♪

00:00:58.190 --> 00:01:00.827
[ Camera shutters clicking ]
-Ooh!

00:01:00.827 --> 00:01:02.094
-Kim, who are you wearing?!

00:01:02.094 --> 00:01:03.997
-Um, a bunch of clothes.

00:01:03.997 --> 00:01:05.665
