00:01:09.135 --> 00:01:10.202
-Hey, Aidy.

00:01:10.202 --> 00:01:11.437
-Yes, I'm Aidy.

00:01:11.437 --> 00:01:13.139
-I was thinking,
in the office sketch,

00:01:13.139 --> 00:01:14.507
we're gonna have you play
Paula Deen,

00:01:14.507 --> 00:01:15.775
and you'll do
a little racist dance.

00:01:15.775 --> 00:01:17.410
Uh, do you like that?
-Yeah.

00:01:17.410 --> 00:01:18.944
Seems like I would say yes.

00:01:18.944 --> 00:01:21.147
[ Camera shutter clicking ]
-Yes.

00:01:21.147 --> 00:01:23.149
Oh! You're looking great, Kim.

00:01:23.149 --> 00:01:24.583
Do you have a few more in you?

00:01:24.583 --> 00:01:27.620
-Yeah.
Maybe get the whole body.

00:01:27.620 --> 00:01:31.857
-Hey, yesterday, did she have
that massive bush?

00:01:31.857 --> 00:01:33.259
[ Camera shutter clicks ]

00:01:33.259 --> 00:01:35.895
-All -- All men want
a piece of ass.

00:01:35.895 --> 00:01:37.430
Natural sex.

00:01:37.430 --> 00:01:39.065 line:0%
♪♪

00:01:40.365 --> 00:01:43.669
-Medical grade sunscreen.

00:01:43.669 --> 00:01:45.671
Oh, it's like chowder.

00:01:45.671 --> 00:01:47.306
[ Cellphone chimes ]
